            "Mkubwa, mwenye manyoya marefu meupe",
            "Mdogo, mwenye manyoya marefu meupe",
            "Mkubwa, mwenye manyoya mafupi ya kahawia",
            "Mdogo, mwenye manyoya mafupi ya kahawia"
          ],
          "answer": 3
        },
        {
          "question": "Ni mbwa yupi mdogo kwa umri?",
          "choices": [
